      "review": "REFUSAL ONLY: 217 reviewed eligible effect route receives its own seeded, owned proposed action with matching method/path/query/canonical JSON hash or exact bounded multipart bytes/MIME/boundary hash. Real HTTP must return the exact assistant guard409; independent DB read leaves proposed state and no approval, dispatch, finish or HTTP-result metadata. Real owned session created via API. Three effectful GET routes and all three multipart routes included; secure UI and unavailable operations retained. Bodies intentionally need not pass domain validation because domain handlers must never run. Does not prove proposal/material capture, approval-success, UI default preview, native conversational bridge, secure handoff or business result. Entire fresh passing case plus observed per-operation409 required; source alone is not executed evidence. Key creation is reviewed separately as exact secure-policy422; revocation remains strict approval409."
